          "detail": "the `sampling/createMessage` request's `messages[1]` is the last message, with no tool results after it"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "section": "client/sampling#security-considerations",
        "quote": "Servers MUST ensure that when replying to a `stopReason: \"toolUse\"`, each `ToolUseContent` item is responded to with a `ToolResultContent` item with a matching `toolUseId`, and that the user message contains only tool results (no other content types)",
        "url": "https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2025-11-25/client/sampling#security-considerations"
